{"sections":[{"slug":"Kan扩张","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Kan扩张"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Kan 扩张"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于函子</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及范畴</span> $\\mathcal E$, <span lang=\"zh\">有拉回函子</span>\n$$\r\nf^*\\colon \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\to \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">左右</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE}_f,\\operatorname{RKE}_f\r\n\\colon \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\to \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即是</span> $f^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左右伴随</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">计算式</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">左右</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张具有用余极限和极限的具体计算式</span>:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE}_f (F)(d) = \\operatorname{colim}_{f(c) \\to d} F(c),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{RKE}_f (F)(d) = \\operatorname{lim}_{d\\to f(c)} F(c).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh\">左</span></th><th><span lang=\"zh\">右</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">张量积</span> $\\otimes$</td><td>Hom</td></tr>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh\">极限</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span> (realization)</td><td><span lang=\"zh\">全体</span> (totalization)</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">极限</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于指标范畴</span> $\\mathcal I$, <span lang=\"zh\">沿</span> $\\mathcal I\\to 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左右</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span> $\\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">分别为余极限和极限</span>:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE} (X) = \\operatorname{colim}_{i} X(i),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{RKE} (X) = \\operatorname{lim}_{i} X(i).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span></h3>\n<p>$|{-}|\\colon \\Delta\\to\\mathsf {Top}$ <span lang=\"zh\">沿</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{y}\\colon \\Delta\\to\\mathsf {sSet}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span> $\\mathsf {sSet}\\to\\mathsf {Top}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为单纯集的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span>"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n|X| := \\operatorname{colim}_{\\Delta^n \\to X} |\\Delta^n|,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\Delta^n = \\mathbf{y}([n])$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴之间的伴随</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层范畴之间的伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴之间的伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}